# 6. Working Principle

1. Customer places product into the cart.
2. RFID reader scans the RFID tag attached to product.
3. ESP32 identifies product and fetches details.
4. Product name and price displayed on OLED.
5. Total bill updated automatically.
6. AI camera verifies product using object detection.
7. Load cell checks weight mismatch for theft prevention.
8. Final bill sent to mobile app or cloud database.

